{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1141450-seeing-if-any-one-would-want-to-play-changeling-the-dreaming-20-online","id":1141450,"title":"Seeing if any one would want to play Changeling the Dreaming 20 online","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-09-18T10:18:04-07:00","id":1141450,"title":"Seeing if any one would want to play Changeling the Dreaming 20 online","content":"<span style=\"font-family:times new roman, times, serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">[Sorry for any </span><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>formatting</b></span><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> issues I </span><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>coped</b></span><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> this from a google doc and I can't seem to fix it here]</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:times new roman, times, serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">When the Backer PDF first came out I posted online to see if anyone wanted to play and online game; I didn\u2019t get to much interest. Now that the PDF is officially out I\u2019m going to try again; but this time I\u2019m going to see if there is any interest in the plot ideas/arc I currently have.</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">On of the things I wanted to do was wait a bit on the setting until I get an Idea of characters [I don\u2019t want plan for a noble game and find out everyone wants to be dirty dirty commoners :P], But I will give a brief idea of some of the ideas I\u2019m thinking of, with the rest of the plot arc and tweeking made to fit the characters. </span></span></span><ul><li><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">Small pair of Counties in the Dutchy of the Four Winds [Hey I\u2019m from the area so I might not get lost in looking up history of the area or try to make up my own place\u2026 that end up being larger than a metropolis]; When one of the Counts dies without naming heir the player find themselves try deal with the aftermath [I could change the location but I figure if people really wanted]</span></span></li> <li><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">On Youtube and other video sites - there have been groups of videos that show the Dreaming. The players find out that most of these videos are \u2018starting\u2019 them and after getting called in front of the local courts about their blatant breaking of Escheat they realized that someone/thing is following them and taking these\u2026 and now they have a deadline to find out what is going on before they have to deal with the punishments</span></span></li> <li><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">There is a mysterious person that is roaming around causing people to vanish, who then show up mindless husks later on but when a changeling looks at one why find they are fonts of glamour that act as strong as a balefire. </span></span></li> <li><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\">Trying to turn and recently abandoned mall into a large \u2018new\u2019 style of Freehold where dreamers/humans are \u2018sent through an Augmented reality funhouse\u2019 </span></span></li> </ul><br /> <span style=\"font-family:times new roman, times, serif\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Now as for the online part I used to run a Scion game [at first it was on google wave but </span><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>sadly</b></span><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> that was shut down] On a mix of Goggle docs for the main parts of the story and Skype for Occ and for heavy combat bits; </span></span></span><br /> doing it this way is a bit like play by post where people can write what they need/want in a doc and others can reply and there is a way to see what others are writing and when things were edited there is the same down side of waiting like there is with play by post but I don't feel it as bad. <br /> <br /> If you have any question or comments feel free to post here or PM me; and If we get enough people I'll start a game<br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><br /> <br /> </span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/324-ardenty","name":"ardenty","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar324_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-27T14:52:28-08:00","id":1163103,"title":"","content":"Hey! I had a similar experience in anticipation of C20's release, lol. You might be interested to know that there is a Changeling play by post on our forum if you're interested in playing. Here's a link to our ad here: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1111701-c20-and-w20-play-by-post-looking-for-players\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/g...ng-for-players</a><br /> <br /> Feel free to message me if you have have questions / concerns.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i43.photobucket.com/albums/e384/GrottyGilgamesh/3812c9a0-1510-4235-a3d4-1993f1a47b4b_zpsd6723580.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4266-mousegbn","name":"MouseGBN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4266_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-n